# Google OAuth client ID used by every Drive-backed feature
# (invoices, knowledge, notes, passwords).
#
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   1. Create credentials → OAuth client ID → Web application
#   2. Authorised JavaScript origins: http://localhost:3000
#      (add your production origin too, e.g. https://posteena.example)
#   3. Enable the Google Drive API for the project
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill the value in, then restart `npm run dev`.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
